-- AIA Khoe Tron Ven V012022 — Annex 7 (Phụ lục 7: Định nghĩa Bệnh hiểm nghèo giai đoạn nghiêm
-- trọng), the 45 severe-stage critical illnesses, and the summary list annex that precedes
-- Annex 5 (Phụ lục danh sách Bệnh ung thư và Bệnh hiểm nghèo). One rule per item, numbered as
-- the Annex numbers them. Items 35-45 apply only to a diagnosis before age 18, or from the 18th
-- birthday until the next policy anniversary; that limb reads the policy and is added in
-- `Annex 7 — under ..., the diagnosis meets the definition` at the end.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/aia-khoe-tron-ven.txt.
-- Threshold words are read as in ktv-annex6-early-ci.l4.

§ `Annex 7 — severe-stage critical illnesses`

§§ `The summary list annex`

