-- src:2634 | Phụ lục 7: Định nghĩa Bệnh hiểm nghèo giai đoạn nghiêm trọng

§§ `1. Coronary artery bypass surgery`

-- src:2641 | 1. Phẫu thuật bắc cầu động mạch vành
-- (src 2641-2645: 4 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(1) (src 2641-2645)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: coronary artery bypass surgery`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(1) — coronary artery bypass surgery` f MEANS
        f's `open-chest surgery grafting a vessel to bypass a diseased coronary artery`
    AND NOT f's `by angioplasty, another endovascular procedure, a catheter, keyhole surgery or laser`

§§ `2. Heart attack`

-- src:2647 | 2. Nhồi máu cơ tim
-- (src 2647-2652: 5 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2658 | Loại trừ cơn đau thắt ngực.
@ref Annex 7(2) (src 2647-2658)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: heart attack`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(2) — heart attack` f MEANS
        f's `death of heart muscle from ischaemia`
    AND "(a)" ... f's `history of typical prolonged chest pain`
    AND "(b)" ... f's `new ECG changes of infarction`
    AND "(c)" ... (    f's `CK-MB above the normal threshold`
                   OR  f's `troponin T, ng per ml` GREATER THAN 1.0
                   OR  f's `troponin I at the equivalent level`)
    AND NOT f's `angina only`

§§ `3. Severe cardiomyopathy`

-- src:2664 | 3. Bệnh cơ tim nặng
-- src:2670 | Suy giảm chức năng cơ tim được Bác sĩ chuyên khoa chẩn đoán là bệnh cơ tim, làm suy giảm
-- (src 2670-2671: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2674 | hội Tim mạch New York hay phân loại tương đương. Chẩn đoán bệnh cơ tim phải có kết quả
-- (src 2674-2675: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2689 | Loại trừ Bệnh cơ tim liên quan đến sử dụng thức uống có cồn hay chất gây nghiện.
@ref Annex 7(3) (src 2664-2689)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: severe cardiomyopathy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(3) — severe cardiomyopathy` f MEANS
        f's `cardiomyopathy diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND f's `NYHA class of the permanent physical impairment` AT LEAST 3
    AND f's `months the impairment has lasted` AT LEAST 6
    AND f's `echocardiogram assessing ventricular function`
    AND NOT f's `related to alcohol or addictive substances`

§§ `4. Heart valve surgery`

-- src:2695 | 4. Phẫu thuật van tim
-- (src 2695-2696: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2702 | thường.
-- src:2708 | Loại trừ sửa chữa van tim bằng các phẫu thuật can thiệp nội mạch, phẫu thuật “lỗ khóa” (key-
-- (src 2708-2709: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(4) (src 2695-2709)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: heart valve surgery`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(4) — heart valve surgery` f MEANS
        f's `open-heart surgery to replace or repair a defective or abnormal heart valve`
    AND NOT f's `repair by an endovascular procedure, keyhole surgery or a similar procedure`

§§ `5. Surgery to the aorta`

-- src:2716 | 5. Phẫu thuật động mạch chủ
-- (src 2716-2722: 6 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(5) (src 2716-2722)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: surgery to the aorta`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(5) — surgery to the aorta` f MEANS
        f's `surgery opening the chest or abdomen to treat aneurysm, occlusion, coarctation or dissection of the aorta`
    AND f's `on the thoracic or abdominal aorta itself, not a branch`
    AND NOT f's `by angioplasty, another endovascular procedure, a catheter, keyhole surgery or laser`

§§ `6. Primary pulmonary arterial hypertension`

-- src:2724 | 6. Tăng áp lực động mạch phổi nguyên phát
-- (src 2724-2728: 4 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(6) (src 2724-2737)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: primary pulmonary arterial hypertension`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(6) — primary pulmonary arterial hypertension` f MEANS
        f's `primary pulmonary hypertension with marked right ventricular enlargement on cardiac catheterisation`
    AND f's `NYHA class of the permanent irreversible physical impairment` AT LEAST 3
    AND f's `months the impairment has lasted` AT LEAST 6
    AND NOT f's `pulmonary hypertension from another cause`

§§ `7. Coma lasting at least 96 hours`

-- src:2739 | 7. Hôn mê kéo dài ít nhất 96 giờ
-- (src 2739-2744: 5 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(7) (src 2739-2744)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: coma lasting at least 96 hours`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(7) — coma lasting at least 96 hours` f MEANS
        f's `hours of continuous unconsciousness without response to external stimuli or internal needs` AT LEAST 96
    AND f's `on a ventilator to sustain life`
    AND f's `months the permanent neurological deficit has lasted since diagnosis` AT LEAST 3
    AND f's `confirmed by a specialist`
    AND NOT f's `caused by self-inflicted injury, alcohol or drug abuse`

§§ `8. Stroke`

-- src:2750 | 8. Đột quỵ
-- src:2756 | Đột quỵ là tai biến mạch máu não có di chứng thần kinh vĩnh viễn, kéo dài ít nhất 45 ngày bao
-- (src 2756-2757: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2763 | thể hiện trên kết quả chụp cộng hưởng từ (MRI), chụp cắt lớp (CT) và được Bác sĩ chuyên khoa
-- (src 2763-2764: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2767 | Loại trừ các triệu chứng thần kinh do cơn thiếu máu não thoáng qua, các suy giảm chức năng
-- (src 2767-2768: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(8) (src 2750-2772)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: stroke`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(8) — stroke` f MEANS
        f's `cerebrovascular event with permanent neurological sequelae, including infarction, haemorrhage or embolism`
    AND f's `days the sequelae have lasted` AT LEAST 45
    AND f's `changes shown on MRI or CT, confirmed by a specialist`
    AND NOT f's `of a kind the definition excludes: TIA, reversible ischaemic deficit, vertebrobasilar ischaemia, migraine, traumatic or hypoxic brain injury, or vascular disease of the eye, optic nerve or vestibular function`

§§ `9. Benign brain tumour`

-- src:2776 | 9. U não lành tính
-- src:2781 | U não hay u màng não lành tính đe dọa tính mạng và xuất hiện các triệu chứng đặc trưng của
-- (src 2781-2782: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2788 | được chẩn đoán dựa vào kết quả chụp cộng hưởng từ (MRI) hoặc chụp cắt lớp (CT).
-- (src 2788-2789: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2795 | yên, u cột sống, u dây thần kinh thính giác.
@ref Annex 7(9) (src 2776-2795)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: benign brain tumour`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(9) — benign brain tumour` f MEANS
        f's `life-threatening benign tumour of the brain or meninges`
    AND f's `characteristic signs of raised intracranial pressure such as papilloedema, mental symptoms, seizures or sensory disturbance`
    AND f's `diagnosed on MRI or CT`
    AND NOT f's `a cyst, granuloma, cerebral arterial or venous malformation, haemangioma, pituitary tumour, spinal tumour or acoustic neuroma`

§§ `10. Severe head injury`

-- src:2801 | 10. Chấn thương đầu nặng
-- src:2807 | Là chấn thương sọ não do tai nạn, làm rối loạn chức năng thần kinh nghiêm trọng vĩnh viễn,
-- src:2813 | kéo dài ít nhất 3 tháng kể từ ngày bị chấn thương. Tổn thương chức năng thần kinh vĩnh viễn
-- (src 2813-2817: 4 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(10) (src 2801-2824)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: severe head injury`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(10) — severe head injury` f MEANS
        f's `head injury from an accident with severe permanent neurological dysfunction`
    AND f's `months it has lasted since the injury` AT LEAST 3
    AND f's `confirmed by a neurologist`
    AND `the number of distinct activities of daily living in` (f's `activities of daily living permanently lost`) AT LEAST 3

§§ `11. Open brain surgery`

-- src:2829 | 11. Phẫu thuật não hở
-- src:2836 | Là phẫu thuật não hoặc nội sọ có gây mê và mở hộp sọ.
-- (src 2836-2838: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(11) (src 2829-2838)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: open brain surgery`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(11) — open brain surgery` f MEANS
        f's `brain or intracranial surgery under anaesthesia with craniotomy`
    AND NOT f's `burr-hole, transsphenoidal or other minimally invasive surgery for accidental head injury`

§§ `12. Alzheimer disease or dementia`

-- src:2840 | 12. Bệnh Alzheimer hoặc Sa sút trí tuệ
-- (src 2840-2846: 6 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(12) (src 2840-2846)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: Alzheimer disease or dementia`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(12) — Alzheimer disease or dementia` f MEANS
        f's `dementia, loss of intellect or abnormal behaviour from Alzheimer disease or severe impairment of mental and social function`
    AND f's `needing continuous supervision`
    AND f's `diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND NOT f's `a non-organic brain disorder such as neurosis or a psychiatric illness`
    AND NOT f's `brain damage related to alcohol or addictive substances`

§§ `13. Motor neurone disease`

-- src:2852 | 13. Bệnh tế bào thần kinh vận động
-- (src 2852-2853: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2859 | kinh vận động hành tủy. Bệnh bao gồm các loại: teo cơ do tủy, liệt hành tủy tiến triển, xơ cứng
-- (src 2859-2860: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2866 | đoán và xác nhận tình trạng bệnh đang tiến triển và có di chứng thần kinh vĩnh viễn kéo dài ít
@ref Annex 7(13) (src 2852-2870)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: motor neurone disease`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(13) — motor neurone disease` f MEANS
        f's `progressive degeneration of the corticospinal tracts and anterior horn cells or bulbar motor neurons`
    AND f's `diagnosed by a specialist, who confirms it is progressing`
    AND f's `months the permanent neurological deficit has lasted since diagnosis` AT LEAST 3

§§ `14. Multiple sclerosis`

-- src:2871 | 14. Bệnh xơ cứng rải rác
-- (src 2871-2873: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2877 | (a) Triệu chứng liên quan bó thần kinh (chất trắng) bao gồm thần kinh thị giác, thân não và tủy
-- (src 2877-2878: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2883 | (b) Các tổn thương tách biệt hoặc đa dạng;
-- (src 2883-2884: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(14) (src 2871-2890)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: multiple sclerosis`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(14) — multiple sclerosis` f MEANS
        f's `diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND f's `months during which all the conditions have continued` AT LEAST 6
    AND "(a)" ... f's `symptoms of the nerve tracts, white matter, optic nerve, brain stem and spinal cord impairing neurological function`
    AND "(b)" ... f's `separate or multiple lesions`
    AND "(c)" ... f's `a history clearly confirming severe relapses and remissions`

§§ `15. Severe viral encephalitis`

-- src:2896 | 15. Viêm não nặng do vi rút
-- src:2902 | Viêm nhu mô não nặng gây ra di chứng thần kinh vĩnh viễn trong thời gian ít nhất 30 ngày và
-- (src 2902-2903: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2909 | Loại trừ viêm não liên quan đến HIV.
@ref Annex 7(15) (src 2896-2909)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: severe viral encephalitis`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(15) — severe viral encephalitis` f MEANS
        f's `severe inflammation of the brain tissue`
    AND f's `days the permanent neurological sequelae have lasted` AT LEAST 30
    AND f's `confirmed by a specialist`
    AND NOT f's `HIV-related encephalitis`

§§ `16. Bacterial meningitis`

-- src:2915 | 16. Viêm màng não do vi khuẩn
-- (src 2915-2918: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(16) (src 2915-2918)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: bacterial meningitis`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(16) — bacterial meningitis` f MEANS
        f's `bacterial inflammation of the meninges of the brain or spinal cord`
    AND f's `days the permanent neurological sequelae have lasted` AT LEAST 30
    AND f's `diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND f's `bacteria found in cerebrospinal fluid on lumbar puncture`

§§ `17. Severe Parkinson disease`

-- src:2920 | 17. Bệnh Parkinson nặng
-- (src 2920-2923: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2930 | (c) Mất vĩnh viễn khả năng thực hiện độc lập ít nhất 3 Hoạt động sinh hoạt hàng ngày cho dù
-- (src 2930-2933: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(17) (src 2920-2940)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: severe Parkinson disease`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(17) — severe Parkinson disease` f MEANS
        f's `Parkinson disease diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND "(a)" ... f's `not controllable by medication`
    AND "(b)" ... f's `signs of progression`
    AND "(c)" ... `the number of distinct activities of daily living in` (f's `activities of daily living permanently lost`) AT LEAST 3
    AND NOT f's `drug-induced or toxic parkinsonism`

§§ `18. Poliomyelitis`

-- src:2942 | 18. Bại liệt
-- src:2948 | Chẩn đoán Bại liệt cần thỏa các điều kiện sau:
-- (src 2948-2949: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2955 | (b) Liệt các cơ của chi hoặc các cơ hô hấp kéo dài ít nhất 3 tháng.
@ref Annex 7(18) (src 2942-2955)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: poliomyelitis`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(18) — poliomyelitis` f MEANS
        "(a)" ... f's `caused by the poliovirus`
    AND "(b)" ... f's `months the paralysis of limb or respiratory muscles has lasted` AT LEAST 3

§§ `19. Chronic liver failure`

-- src:2961 | 19. Suy gan mạn
-- src:2965 | Suy gan mạn cần có tất cả các điều kiện sau:
-- (src 2965-2966: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2968 | (b) Cổ trướng (Báng bụng);
-- (src 2968-2969: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2973 | Loại trừ suy gan do rượu, chất gây nghiện hoặc ngộ độc.
@ref Annex 7(19) (src 2961-2973)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: chronic liver failure`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(19) — chronic liver failure` f MEANS
        "(a)" ... f's `permanent jaundice`
    AND "(b)" ... f's `ascites`
    AND "(c)" ... f's `hepatic encephalopathy`
    AND NOT f's `from alcohol, addictive substances or poisoning`

§§ `20. Fulminant viral hepatitis`

-- src:2978 | 20. Viêm gan siêu vi tối cấp
-- (src 2978-2979: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2985 | kiện sau:
-- (src 2985-2986: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:2992 | (b) Suy giảm nhanh chóng men gan;
-- src:2998 | (c) Vàng da sậm;
-- (src 2998-2999: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(20) (src 2978-2999)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: fulminant viral hepatitis`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(20) — fulminant viral hepatitis` f MEANS
        f's `severe liver necrosis from viral hepatitis leading to liver failure`
    AND "(a)" ... f's `rapid shrinking of the liver with necrosis of all the lobules`
    AND "(b)" ... f's `rapid fall in liver enzymes`
    AND "(c)" ... f's `deep jaundice`
    AND "(d)" ... f's `hepatic encephalopathy`

§§ `21. Chronic relapsing pancreatitis`

-- src:3006 | 21. Viêm tụy mạn tính tái phát
-- (src 3006-3015: 9 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(21) (src 3006-3015)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: chronic relapsing pancreatitis`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(21) — chronic relapsing pancreatitis` f MEANS
        f's `progressive destruction of the pancreas from recurrent acute pancreatitis`
    AND "(a)" ... f's `years over which acute pancreatitis has recurred` AT LEAST 2
    AND "(b)" ... f's `diffuse calcification of the pancreas on CT, MRI or ultrasound`
    AND "(c)" ... f's `continuous chronic pancreatic dysfunction with malabsorption or insulin-dependent diabetes`
    AND NOT f's `from alcohol abuse, a congenital defect or a hereditary disease`

§§ `22. Chronic lung disease`

-- src:3022 | 22. Bệnh phổi mạn tính
-- src:3029 | Bệnh phổi giai đoạn cuối gây ra suy hô hấp mạn tính và thỏa mãn tất cả các điều kiện sau:
-- (src 3029-3033: 4 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- "ít hơn một lít" (less than one litre) is LESS THAN 1; "thấp hơn hoặc bằng 55 mmHg" AT MOST 55.
@ref Annex 7(22) (src 3022-3033)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: chronic lung disease`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(22) — chronic lung disease` f MEANS
        f's `end-stage lung disease with chronic respiratory failure`
    AND "(a)" ... (f's `needing continuous supplementary oxygen` AND f's `FEV1, litres` LESS THAN 1)
    AND "(b)" ... f's `arterial oxygen partial pressure, mmHg` AT MOST 55
    AND "(c)" ... f's `breathless at rest`

§§ `23. Kidney failure`

-- src:3035 | 23. Suy thận
-- (src 3035-3037: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(23) (src 3035-3037)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: kidney failure`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(23) — kidney failure` f MEANS
        f's `irreversible end-stage chronic failure of both kidneys`
    AND f's `needing regular dialysis or a kidney transplant`

§§ `24. Systemic lupus erythematosus`

-- src:3039 | 24. Bệnh Lupus ban đỏ hệ thống
-- (src 3039-3040: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3046 | các kháng nguyên tự thân. Bệnh Lupus ban đỏ hệ thống phải được Bác sĩ chuyên khoa chẩn
-- (src 3046-3047: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3053 | thương thận do Lupus của Tổ chức Y tế thế giới. Loại trừ bệnh lupus dạng đĩa hoặc các bệnh
-- (src 3053-3054: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(24) (src 3039-3071)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: systemic lupus erythematosus`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(24) — systemic lupus erythematosus` f MEANS
        f's `diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND f's `WHO lupus nephritis class on kidney biopsy` AT LEAST 3
    AND f's `WHO lupus nephritis class on kidney biopsy` AT MOST  5
    AND NOT f's `discoid lupus, or lupus with only haematological and joint involvement`

§§ `25. Aplastic anaemia`

-- src:3073 | 25. Thiếu máu bất sản
-- src:3078 | Suy giảm chức năng tủy xương vĩnh viễn, không thể phục hồi, gây thiếu máu, giảm bạch cầu
-- (src 3078-3079: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3085 | (a) Truyền máu;
-- (src 3085-3086: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3093 | (c) Thuốc ức chế miễn dịch; hoặc
-- (src 3093-3094: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3100 | Chẩn đoán phải được xác nhận dựa vào kết quả sinh thiết tủy xương.
@ref Annex 7(25) (src 3073-3100)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: aplastic anaemia`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(25) — aplastic anaemia` f MEANS
        f's `permanent irreversible bone-marrow failure with anaemia, leukopenia and thrombocytopenia`
    AND count (filter (GIVEN b YIELD b)
                      (LIST f's `treated by blood transfusion`,
                            f's `treated with marrow-stimulating drugs`,
                            f's `treated with immunosuppressants`,
                            f's `treated by bone marrow transplant`)) AT LEAST 2
    AND f's `confirmed on bone-marrow biopsy`

§§ `26. Bone marrow transplant`

-- src:3106 | 26. Ghép tủy xương
-- (src 3106-3109: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(26) (src 3106-3109)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: bone marrow transplant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(26) — bone marrow transplant` f MEANS
        f's `human bone marrow transplant using haematopoietic stem cells after total marrow ablation`
    AND NOT f's `a transplant of other stem cells`

§§ `27. Major organ transplant`

-- src:3111 | 27. Ghép tạng
-- (src 3111-3114: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(27) (src 3111-3114)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: major organ transplant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(27) — major organ transplant` f MEANS
        f's `transplant of the heart, a lung, the liver, a kidney or the pancreas`
    AND f's `for irreversible end-stage failure of that organ`
    AND NOT f's `a transplant of stem cells or islet cells`

§§ `28. Severe burns`

-- src:3121 | 28. Bỏng nặng
-- (src 3121-3123: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(28) (src 3121-3123)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: severe burns`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(28) — severe burns` f MEANS
        f's `percent of the body surface with third-degree burns` AT LEAST 20
    AND f's `percent of the body surface treated by skin grafting` AT LEAST 10

§§ `29. Loss of independent existence`

-- src:3125 | 29. Mất khả năng sống độc lập
-- (src 3125-3131: 6 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(29) (src 3125-3153)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: loss of independent existence`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(29) — loss of independent existence` f MEANS
        f's `confirmed by a specialist`
    AND f's `months it has lasted` AT LEAST 6
    AND `the number of distinct activities of daily living in` (f's `activities of daily living permanently lost`) AT LEAST 3
    AND NOT f's `from a psychiatric cause`

§§ `30. HIV infection from an occupational accident`

-- src:3155 | 30. Nhiễm HIV do tai nạn nghề nghiệp
-- src:3158 | Nhiễm HIV do Tai nạn trong khi Người được bảo hiểm đang thực hiện nhiệm vụ theo đúng
-- (src 3158-3160: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3164 | (a) Có bằng chứng về việc chuyển đảo huyết thanh từ âm tính với HIV thành dương tính với HIV
-- (src 3164-3165: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3170 | tính của Người được bảo hiểm được thực hiện trong vòng 7 ngày kể từ ngày xảy ra Tai nạn;
-- (src 3170-3171: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3177 | (c) Bằng chứng về Tai nạn dẫn đến việc nhiễm HIV của Người được bảo hiểm phải được thông
-- (src 3177-3178: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3184 | Loại trừ nhiễm HIV qua các đường khác, bao gồm nhưng không giới hạn do bị lây truyền qua
-- src:3190 | đường tình dục, truyền máu hay tiêm chích ma túy.
-- (src 3190-3191: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3197 | khoa, sinh viên y khoa, y tá, điều dưỡng, kỹ thuật viên y tế, nha sĩ hoặc nhân viên y tế đang làm
-- src:3203 | việc hoặc học tập tại các cơ sở khám chữa bệnh được thành lập và hoạt động hợp pháp tại Việt
-- (src 3203-3206: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- The last sentence, "sẽ không được chi trả nếu đã có phương pháp điều trị hiệu quả bệnh HIV",
-- is a fact the record carries; whether antiretroviral therapy is "an effective treatment" is
-- not decided here (finding X13).
@ref Annex 7(30) (src 3155-3206)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: HIV infection from an occupational accident`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(30) — HIV infection from an occupational accident` f MEANS
        f's `infected in an Accident while performing professional duties as Vietnamese law prescribes`
    AND "(a)" ... f's `months from the Accident to the seroconversion` AT MOST 6
    AND           `within days of the Accident:` 7 (f's `days from the Accident to a negative HIV test`)
    AND "(b)" ... f's `evidence clearly identifying the source of infection`
    AND "(c)" ... `within days of the Accident:` 30 (f's `days from the Accident to notice to the Company`)
    AND NOT f's `infected by another route such as sex, transfusion or drug injection`
    AND (CONSIDER f's `the insured's occupation`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
         WHEN JUST `the occupation` THEN TRUE)
    AND f's `working or studying at a lawfully established health-care facility in Vietnam`
    AND NOT f's `an effective treatment for HIV exists`
    WHERE
        `within days of the Accident:` `the limit` `the days` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the days`
            WHEN NOTHING   THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST `n`  THEN `n` AT MOST `the limit`

§§ `31. Muscular dystrophy`

-- src:3208 | 31. Loạn dưỡng cơ
-- (src 3208-3213: 5 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3219 | (d) Kết quả sinh thiết cơ có bất thường của bệnh loạn dưỡng cơ.
-- src:3226 | Không chi trả quyền lợi bảo hiểm khi dấu hiệu, triệu chứng bệnh đầu tiên xuất hiện trước khi
-- (src 3226-3227: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(31) (src 3208-3227)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: muscular dystrophy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(31) — muscular dystrophy` f MEANS
        f's `confirmed by a specialist`
    AND count (filter (GIVEN b YIELD b)
                      (LIST f's `family history of other members with the disease`,
                            f's `no sensory disturbance, normal cerebrospinal fluid and mildly reduced tendon reflexes`,
                            f's `characteristic electromyogram`,
                            f's `muscle biopsy showing muscular dystrophy`)) AT LEAST 3
    AND NOT f's `first signs or symptoms appeared before age 18`

§§ `32. Loss of hearing`

-- src:3229 | 32. Mất thính lực
-- (src 3229-3233: 4 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(32) (src 3229-3233)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: loss of hearing`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(32) — loss of hearing` f MEANS
        f's `complete irreversible loss of hearing in both ears from illness or accidental injury`
    AND f's `confirmed by a specialist`
    AND f's `hearing loss at every frequency in both ears, decibels` AT LEAST 80
    AND f's `months from the diagnosis to the audiometry` AT LEAST 3

§§ `33. Loss of speech`

-- src:3235 | 33. Mất khả năng phát âm
-- (src 3235-3238: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(33) (src 3235-3238)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: loss of speech`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(33) — loss of speech` f MEANS
        f's `complete irreversible loss of the ability to speak from an Accident or illness`
    AND f's `continuous months without speech` AT LEAST 12
    AND f's `specialist medical evidence of injury or disease of the vocal cords`
    AND NOT f's `from a psychiatric cause`

§§ `34. Terminal illness`

-- src:3244 | 34. Bệnh giai đoạn cuối
-- src:3250 | Là tình trạng bệnh được 2 Bác sĩ chuyên khoa xác nhận không thể điều trị khỏi hay không có
-- (src 3250-3251: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3257 | xác nhận này cần dựa vào các bằng chứng phù hợp bao gồm hồ sơ khám và các xét nghiệm
-- (src 3257-3258: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(34) (src 3244-3258)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: terminal illness`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(34) — terminal illness` f MEANS
        f's `specialists confirming it` AT LEAST 2
    AND f's `incurable or without any effective treatment`
    AND f's `months within which death is expected` AT MOST 6
    AND f's `based on appropriate evidence, records and tests`

