-- src:3287 | trăm (1%). Chẩn đoán phải được Bác sĩ chuyên khoa xác nhận.
@ref Annex 7(36) (src 3274-3300)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: severe haemophilia`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(36) — severe haemophilia` f MEANS
        f's `haemophilia A or B`
    AND f's `factor VIII or IX level, percent` LESS THAN 1
    AND f's `confirmed by a specialist`

§§ `37. Rheumatic heart disease`

-- src:3306 | 37. Bệnh thấp tim
-- (src 3306-3309: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(37) (src 3306-3312)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: rheumatic heart disease`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(37) — rheumatic heart disease` f MEANS
        f's `acute rheumatic fever diagnosed by a paediatric specialist on the revised Jones criteria (2015)`
    AND f's `heart valves damaged by rheumatism on echocardiogram` AT LEAST 1

§§ `38. Osteogenesis imperfecta`

-- src:3314 | 38. Bệnh xương thủy tinh
-- (src 3314-3316: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3322 | - Khám lâm sàng có chậm phát triển và giảm thính lực và
-- (src 3322-3324: 2 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
@ref Annex 7(38) (src 3314-3327)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: osteogenesis imperfecta`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(38) — osteogenesis imperfecta` f MEANS
        f's `type III confirmed by a specialist`
    AND f's `growth retardation and hearing loss on clinical examination`
    AND f's `multiple fractures and progressive kyphoscoliosis on X-ray`
    AND f's `positive skin biopsy`

