@ref Annex 7(39) (src 3329-3334)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: type 1 diabetes`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(39) — type 1 diabetes` f MEANS
        f's `diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND f's `months of exogenous insulin treatment` AT LEAST 6

