@ref Annex 7(43) (src 3410-3416)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: Wilson disease`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(43) — Wilson disease` f MEANS
        f's `diagnosed by a specialist`
    AND f's `months of copper-chelation treatment` AT LEAST 6

