`Annex 7(44) — generalised tetanus` f MEANS
        f's `diagnosis established by a specialist`
    AND "a)" ... f's `days of continuous mechanical ventilation` AT LEAST 3
    AND "b)" ... f's `treated with tetanus immune serum`

§§ `45. Status epilepticus`

-- src:3436 | 45. Trạng thái động kinh
-- (src 3436-3439: 3 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3445 | khoa xác nhận cùng với các chứng từ y tế và kết quả điện não đồ.
@ref Annex 7(45) (src 3436-3453)
GIVEN f IS A `Findings: status epilepticus`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7(45) — status epilepticus` f MEANS
        f's `continuous generalised convulsive seizure, or several without recovery of consciousness between them`
    AND f's `needing intubation and ventilation to sustain life`
    AND f's `confirmed by a specialist with medical records and an EEG`

§§ `Items 35-45 — the age limb`

-- src:3446 | Quyền lợi bảo hiểm cho bệnh này chỉ được áp dụng nếu Người được bảo hiểm được chẩn
-- (src 3446-3447: 1 further line(s) not quoted; read them in the source)
-- src:3453 | đồng kế tiếp.
-- Each of items 35-45 ends with this sentence: the benefit for the item applies only if the
-- insured was diagnosed before age 18, or from the 18th birthday until the next policy
-- anniversary.
@ref Annex 7(35)-(45), last sentence of each (e.g. src 3446-3453)
GIVEN `the condition` IS A `Severe-stage critical illness`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7 — an item of the group for diagnoses before age 18:` `the condition` MEANS
    elem `the condition`
         (LIST `Still disease`, `severe haemophilia`, `rheumatic heart disease`, `osteogenesis imperfecta`,
               `type 1 diabetes`, `Kawasaki disease with cardiac complications`,
               `glomerulonephritis with nephrotic syndrome`, `severe hand, foot and mouth disease`,
               `Wilson disease`, `generalised tetanus`, `status epilepticus`)

§§ `Dispatch: which item the findings are about, and whether they meet it`

@ref Annex 7 (src 2634-3453)
GIVEN `the findings` IS A `Findings on a severe-stage critical illness`
GIVETH A `Severe-stage critical illness`
`Annex 7 — the item the findings are about` `the findings` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the findings`
    WHEN `findings on coronary artery bypass surgery` x              THEN `coronary artery bypass surgery`
    WHEN `findings on heart attack` x                                THEN `heart attack`
    WHEN `findings on severe cardiomyopathy` x                       THEN `severe cardiomyopathy`
    WHEN `findings on heart valve surgery` x                         THEN `heart valve surgery`
    WHEN `findings on surgery to the aorta` x                        THEN `surgery to the aorta`
    WHEN `findings on primary pulmonary arterial hypertension` x     THEN `primary pulmonary arterial hypertension`
    WHEN `findings on coma lasting at least 96 hours` x              THEN `coma lasting at least 96 hours`
    WHEN `findings on stroke` x                                      THEN `stroke`
    WHEN `findings on benign brain tumour` x                         THEN `benign brain tumour`
    WHEN `findings on severe head injury` x                          THEN `severe head injury`
    WHEN `findings on open brain surgery` x                          THEN `open brain surgery`
    WHEN `findings on Alzheimer disease or dementia` x               THEN `Alzheimer disease or dementia`
    WHEN `findings on motor neurone disease` x                       THEN `motor neurone disease`
    WHEN `findings on multiple sclerosis` x                          THEN `multiple sclerosis`
    WHEN `findings on severe viral encephalitis` x                   THEN `severe viral encephalitis`
    WHEN `findings on bacterial meningitis` x                        THEN `bacterial meningitis`
    WHEN `findings on severe Parkinson disease` x                    THEN `severe Parkinson disease`
    WHEN `findings on poliomyelitis` x                               THEN `poliomyelitis`
    WHEN `findings on chronic liver failure` x                       THEN `chronic liver failure`
    WHEN `findings on fulminant viral hepatitis` x                   THEN `fulminant viral hepatitis`
    WHEN `findings on chronic relapsing pancreatitis` x              THEN `chronic relapsing pancreatitis`
    WHEN `findings on chronic lung disease` x                        THEN `chronic lung disease`
    WHEN `findings on kidney failure` x                              THEN `kidney failure`
    WHEN `findings on systemic lupus erythematosus` x                THEN `systemic lupus erythematosus`
    WHEN `findings on aplastic anaemia` x                            THEN `aplastic anaemia`
    WHEN `findings on bone marrow transplant` x                      THEN `bone marrow transplant`
    WHEN `findings on major organ transplant` x                      THEN `major organ transplant`
    WHEN `findings on severe burns` x                                THEN `severe burns`
    WHEN `findings on loss of independent existence` x               THEN `loss of independent existence`
    WHEN `findings on HIV infection from an occupational accident` x THEN `HIV infection from an occupational accident`
    WHEN `findings on muscular dystrophy` x                          THEN `muscular dystrophy`
    WHEN `findings on loss of hearing` x                             THEN `loss of hearing`
    WHEN `findings on loss of speech` x                              THEN `loss of speech`
    WHEN `findings on terminal illness` x                            THEN `terminal illness`
    WHEN `findings on Still disease` x                               THEN `Still disease`
    WHEN `findings on severe haemophilia` x                          THEN `severe haemophilia`
    WHEN `findings on rheumatic heart disease` x                     THEN `rheumatic heart disease`
    WHEN `findings on osteogenesis imperfecta` x                     THEN `osteogenesis imperfecta`
    WHEN `findings on type 1 diabetes` x                             THEN `type 1 diabetes`
    WHEN `findings on Kawasaki disease with cardiac complications` x THEN `Kawasaki disease with cardiac complications`
    WHEN `findings on glomerulonephritis with nephrotic syndrome` x  THEN `glomerulonephritis with nephrotic syndrome`
    WHEN `findings on severe hand, foot and mouth disease` x         THEN `severe hand, foot and mouth disease`
    WHEN `findings on Wilson disease` x                              THEN `Wilson disease`
    WHEN `findings on generalised tetanus` x                         THEN `generalised tetanus`
    WHEN `findings on status epilepticus` x                          THEN `status epilepticus`

@ref Annex 7 (src 2634-3453)
GIVEN `the findings` IS A `Findings on a severe-stage critical illness`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7 — the findings meet their item` `the findings` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the findings`
    WHEN `findings on coronary artery bypass surgery` x              THEN `Annex 7(1) — coronary artery bypass surgery` x
    WHEN `findings on heart attack` x                                THEN `Annex 7(2) — heart attack` x
    WHEN `findings on severe cardiomyopathy` x                       THEN `Annex 7(3) — severe cardiomyopathy` x
    WHEN `findings on heart valve surgery` x                         THEN `Annex 7(4) — heart valve surgery` x
    WHEN `findings on surgery to the aorta` x                        THEN `Annex 7(5) — surgery to the aorta` x
    WHEN `findings on primary pulmonary arterial hypertension` x     THEN `Annex 7(6) — primary pulmonary arterial hypertension` x
    WHEN `findings on coma lasting at least 96 hours` x              THEN `Annex 7(7) — coma lasting at least 96 hours` x
    WHEN `findings on stroke` x                                      THEN `Annex 7(8) — stroke` x
    WHEN `findings on benign brain tumour` x                         THEN `Annex 7(9) — benign brain tumour` x
    WHEN `findings on severe head injury` x                          THEN `Annex 7(10) — severe head injury` x
    WHEN `findings on open brain surgery` x                          THEN `Annex 7(11) — open brain surgery` x
    WHEN `findings on Alzheimer disease or dementia` x               THEN `Annex 7(12) — Alzheimer disease or dementia` x
    WHEN `findings on motor neurone disease` x                       THEN `Annex 7(13) — motor neurone disease` x
    WHEN `findings on multiple sclerosis` x                          THEN `Annex 7(14) — multiple sclerosis` x
    WHEN `findings on severe viral encephalitis` x                   THEN `Annex 7(15) — severe viral encephalitis` x
    WHEN `findings on bacterial meningitis` x                        THEN `Annex 7(16) — bacterial meningitis` x
    WHEN `findings on severe Parkinson disease` x                    THEN `Annex 7(17) — severe Parkinson disease` x
    WHEN `findings on poliomyelitis` x                               THEN `Annex 7(18) — poliomyelitis` x
    WHEN `findings on chronic liver failure` x                       THEN `Annex 7(19) — chronic liver failure` x
    WHEN `findings on fulminant viral hepatitis` x                   THEN `Annex 7(20) — fulminant viral hepatitis` x
    WHEN `findings on chronic relapsing pancreatitis` x              THEN `Annex 7(21) — chronic relapsing pancreatitis` x
    WHEN `findings on chronic lung disease` x                        THEN `Annex 7(22) — chronic lung disease` x
    WHEN `findings on kidney failure` x                              THEN `Annex 7(23) — kidney failure` x
    WHEN `findings on systemic lupus erythematosus` x                THEN `Annex 7(24) — systemic lupus erythematosus` x
    WHEN `findings on aplastic anaemia` x                            THEN `Annex 7(25) — aplastic anaemia` x
    WHEN `findings on bone marrow transplant` x                      THEN `Annex 7(26) — bone marrow transplant` x
    WHEN `findings on major organ transplant` x                      THEN `Annex 7(27) — major organ transplant` x
    WHEN `findings on severe burns` x                                THEN `Annex 7(28) — severe burns` x
    WHEN `findings on loss of independent existence` x               THEN `Annex 7(29) — loss of independent existence` x
    WHEN `findings on HIV infection from an occupational accident` x THEN `Annex 7(30) — HIV infection from an occupational accident` x
    WHEN `findings on muscular dystrophy` x                          THEN `Annex 7(31) — muscular dystrophy` x
    WHEN `findings on loss of hearing` x                             THEN `Annex 7(32) — loss of hearing` x
    WHEN `findings on loss of speech` x                              THEN `Annex 7(33) — loss of speech` x
    WHEN `findings on terminal illness` x                            THEN `Annex 7(34) — terminal illness` x
    WHEN `findings on Still disease` x                               THEN `Annex 7(35) — Still disease` x
    WHEN `findings on severe haemophilia` x                          THEN `Annex 7(36) — severe haemophilia` x
    WHEN `findings on rheumatic heart disease` x                     THEN `Annex 7(37) — rheumatic heart disease` x
    WHEN `findings on osteogenesis imperfecta` x                     THEN `Annex 7(38) — osteogenesis imperfecta` x
    WHEN `findings on type 1 diabetes` x                             THEN `Annex 7(39) — type 1 diabetes` x
    WHEN `findings on Kawasaki disease with cardiac complications` x THEN `Annex 7(40) — Kawasaki disease with cardiac complications` x
    WHEN `findings on glomerulonephritis with nephrotic syndrome` x  THEN `Annex 7(41) — glomerulonephritis with nephrotic syndrome` x
    WHEN `findings on severe hand, foot and mouth disease` x         THEN `Annex 7(42) — severe hand, foot and mouth disease` x
    WHEN `findings on Wilson disease` x                              THEN `Annex 7(43) — Wilson disease` x
    WHEN `findings on generalised tetanus` x                         THEN `Annex 7(44) — generalised tetanus` x
    WHEN `findings on status epilepticus` x                          THEN `Annex 7(45) — status epilepticus` x

-- The item, the Annex 1 general conditions, and for items 35-45 the age limb at the date of
-- diagnosis.
@ref Annex 1, "Bệnh hiểm nghèo" (src 1536-1547); Annex 7
GIVEN `the policy`    IS A Policy
      `the diagnosis` IS A `Diagnosis of a severe-stage critical illness`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 7 — under` `the policy` `, the diagnosis meets the definition:` `the diagnosis` MEANS
        `Annex 1 — the general conditions of a critical illness hold for the severe-stage diagnosis` `the diagnosis`
    AND `Annex 7 — the findings meet their item` (`the diagnosis`'s `the severe-stage findings`)
    AND (    NOT `Annex 7 — an item of the group for diagnoses before age 18:` (`Annex 7 — the item the findings are about` (`the diagnosis`'s `the severe-stage findings`))
         OR  `on` (`the diagnosis`'s `date of diagnosis`) `the insured has not passed the policy anniversary after reaching age` 18 `under` `the policy`)
